   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/cunning/scoundrel.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Your melee and ranged attacks leave your foes unable to focus on any complex actions, giving them a stacking 3%% chance of failure the next time they try to use a talent (to a maximum of %d%%).\n\t\tIf any effect causes the target's turn to fail they fumble and injure themself, taking %0.2f physical damage.\n\t\tIf the turn loss was caused by this effect then Fumble is removed.\n\t\tThe damage dealt increases with your Cunning.\n\t\t",
   "target": "你的近战和远程攻击会让敌人难以集中精力进行复杂行动，使其叠加 3%% 的下一次技能施放失败几率（最高 %d%%）。\n\t\t如果任何效果导致目标该回合行动失败，对方会失手伤到自己，受到 %0.2f 点物理伤害。\n\t\t如果回合行动失败是由笨拙效果引起的，则会移除笨拙效果。\n\t\t伤害受灵巧加成。\n\t\t",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/cunning/scoundrel.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    183
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5afa5478601c",
   "unit_id": "5afa5478601c17263f80255b47489dd4405c15b19b902a571c7b1c8b81da0272",
   "revision_key": "4abf377447e8e15231876b5fae344f1ce815d943c11d85c5a638ea9571519441",
